Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found your soul strand ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're fated to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Burn !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't let him harm Wan'er's soul strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Flag ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you make one more move,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,this place is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll need to find another method to get my soul strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this place collapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er's soul strand will die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Merge !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help, little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,My only way to find her soul strand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to keep destroying the spirit's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You saved me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then you attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.00,Second,,0,0,0,,Destroy !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:55.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're insane !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destroy !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1598,464)\fad(300,300)}Metal Souls' Basin\NSuzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The collapse is accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must find the central mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,reclaim my soul strand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then I escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Metal soul strands ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,My grandkids,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't you dare provoke your grandpa Xu !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Escaping ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did I say you could escape ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,A spirit formed from metal soul strands
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,resembles a Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means Xu Liguo can counter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's strikingly similar to a celestial sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:08.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such powerful pressure !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This blade is made of a single soul strand, not multiple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Swords have their pride
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and blades have their fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,No no no !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This blade is really fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,the same speed as the 4th primary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,But its attacks are stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,him here !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to you distracting the metal soul strands,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was able to pass safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you a little gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want a rematch with Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that chance today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This half-moon blade doesn't try to harm Xu Liguo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has other intentions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:52.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,bear with it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:54.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:55.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,A devil like you won't die easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I reclaim my soul strand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare forget to save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This blade is a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I come back for Xu Liguo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to subdue it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1602,464)\fad(300,000)}Central spirit mountain outskirts\NSuzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This must be the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Feng refined her into his cauldron
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and she's lost her consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:38.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to deal with her fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's still conscious !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:58.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,would rather die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,than live in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In my centuries of cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you were one of the few people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I, Wang Lin, considered a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that our final battle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,would end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire your pride and your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will grant
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:32.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}Looking back at my youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:32.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}I was the rising star of Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 years to reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I was forever stuck at Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now I'm a puppet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}100 years to Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}will I be remembered or forgotten ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have no hope of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,My only way to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:44.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}It doesn't matter who plays white or black,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:44.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)}the game is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:47.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}All of the discarded pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)}are equally illusory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lived less than 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:52.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}When the mind is empty and dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}it forgets that the violence of the chessboard
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life is like a butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,gone in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that instant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:56.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}was not in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unforgettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:03.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farewell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:10.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}My past life's wounds are willing to become
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:10.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}a butterfly landing on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:18.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will face this disaster and break my chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:18.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will never give up my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:24.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}This is our karma,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:24.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}my death was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:28.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I seek my liberation this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:32.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Please remember me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Feng's domain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,is endless desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,He devours domains to understand them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refine his own domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I leave you my insights of his domain and the Soul Lasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:50.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill Qian Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,a blue rose will bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the northern plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is my gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,By using the Void Ancestor's Skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll open a passage to the Suzaku Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only one person can enter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and time is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't exit before the tattoo fades,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who goes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I find the Cultivation Planet Crystal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use a reverse formation to repair it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and prevent the arrival of the Cultivation Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will protect our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will be dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.48,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1600,454)\fad(300,300)}Central spirit mountain entrance\NSuzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be patient, just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much longer exactly ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yunque Zi was able to breach the barrier and enter the tomb ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:51.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,how did he do it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior has been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This door
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is impossible to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the only path to the first Suzaku's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it won't open without
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to wait a bit more for the collapse of the Suzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the door will open,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.44,0:15:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,allowing us to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's not from planet Suzaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although he's Peak Late stage Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have a strange feeling about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I know which fellow cultivator possessed this body ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Show me your true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I reveal myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Step back !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the spatial rifts !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did it start collapsing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,has almost completely collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,That Zi Xin bitch !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's still not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope Heartless sent you off to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're finally reaching
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the climax of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:33.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:40.88,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:40.88,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:48.48,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:48.48,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:56.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:56.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:59.36,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.36,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:03.08,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.08,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:07.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:10.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:14.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:18.64,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:18.64,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:23.60,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:23.60,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:26.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:29.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:34.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:37.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:42.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:48.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:51.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:56.60,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.60,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:04.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:07.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:12.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:16.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:19.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:23.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:26.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:31.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
